  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF: Child-Community Consultations - CAAFAG Reintegration</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">War Child UK will support child and community consultations in 3 locations in the Masisi area of the DRC. The consultations are part of the efforts to establish the evidence base information required to develop a Joint Global Programme on Child Reintegration. War Child UK will be responsible for identifying the locations for the consultations, for hiring enumerators, for selecting participants to the consultations and for organising and running the consultations in the three sites. Consultations will be in the form of focus group discussions (FGDs).</narrative>
  </description>
